          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Central erythema of cheeks and nose; approximately 6–8 erythematous papules and some pustules; fine telangiectasia. No comedones, phymatous change, scaling, or periorificial pattern."
      }
    },
